      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> composite primary key for all pariticpants in chatId\n--> IndexKey (GSI -- global secondary index) for all chatId participant have\n--> GSI will automatically be kept in sync with base table by DynamoDB\n** Message:\nInbox (for offline user)\n-- receipientId\n-- messageId\nMessage\n- id\n- chatId\n- contents\n- creatorId\n- timestamp\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> composite primary key for all pariticpants in chatId\n--> IndexKey (GSI -- global secondary index) for all chatId participant have\n--> GSI will automatically be kept in sync with base table by DynamoDB\n** Message:\nInbox (for offline user)\n-- receipientId\n-- messageId\nMessage\n- id\n- chatId\n- contents\n- creatorId\n- timestamp\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
