      "updated": 1781830968971,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Adding more chat servers also introduces some new problems: \nnow the sending and receiving users might be connected to different hosts. \nIf User A is trying to send a message to User B and C via Chat Server 1, \nbut User C is connected to Chat Server 2, we're going to have a problem.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Adding more chat servers also introduces some new problems: \nnow the sending and receiving users might be connected to different hosts. \nIf User A is trying to send a message to User B and C via Chat Server 1, \nbut User C is connected to Chat Server 2, we're going to have a problem.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
